<hr>

<article>
  <h2>What is Rolodex?</h2>
  <p>
    Rolodex is a personal gift and birthday tracker built for people who genuinely care about
    the people in their lives, but occasionally forget that Sean's birthday is next Tuesday.
    We've all been there. 😅
  </p>
  <p>
    Keep track of everyone you love, when their birthdays are, what you've gifted them, and
    what you're thinking of getting next. No more last-minute panic buying.
  </p>
</article>

<hr>

<article>
  <h2>✨ What You Can Do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>🎂 <strong>Track birthdays</strong> — see who's coming up in the next 30 days</li>
    <li>📅 <strong>Log important dates</strong> — anniversaries, graduations, you name it</li>
    <li>🎁 <strong>Record gifts you've given</strong> — never accidentally repeat a gift again</li>
    <li>💡 <strong>Save gift ideas</strong> — bookmark ideas (with links!) as they come to you</li>
    <li>📝 <strong>Keep notes on people</strong> — favorite things, sizes, allergies, hobbies</li>
  </ul>
</article>

<hr>

<article>
  <h2>💛 Why We Built This</h2>
  <p>
    Gift giving is one of the best ways to show someone you care, but it's hard to do well
    without a little organization. Rolodex gives you a simple, friendly place to stay on top
    of the people who matter most.
  </p>
  <p>
    No complicated setup, no subscription fees, no noise. Just you and the people you care about.
  </p>
  <p>
    Donations are accepted here: <a href=https://venmo.com/u/Krupal-Sharma role="button">Venmo</a>
  </p>
</article>

